### Variaveis
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2. Listar pacientes
GET {{host}}/api/patients

### 3. Buscar paciente por id
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1

### 4. FALHA PROPOSITAL: paciente inexistente -> esperado 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999

### 5. Cadastrar paciente
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente de Teste",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "nationalId": "888888888888888"
}

### 6. FALHA PROPOSITAL: CNS repetido -> esperado 409
### Rode o bloco 5 e depois este. O primeiro devolve 201, este devolve 409.
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente de Teste (duplicado)",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "nationalId": "888888888888888"
}

### 7. FALHA PROPOSITAL: payload invalido (Zod) -> esperado 400 com "details"
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "birthDate": "data-invalida",
  "nationalId": "123"
}

### 8. Listar atendimentos do paciente 1
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters

### 9. Registrar atendimento
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-09-02T10:00",
  "chiefComplaint": "Consulta de rotina"
}

### 10. FALHA PROPOSITAL: paciente inexistente -> esperado 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999/encounters

### 11. FALHA PROPOSITAL: atendimento sem data valida -> esperado 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chiefComplaint": "Sem data"
}

### ============================================================
### UPLOAD DE FOTO -- precisa do REST Client (VS Code) para
### enviar multipart/form-data direto do editor. Ajuste o
### caminho do arquivo antes de rodar.
### ============================================================

### 12. Upload de foto valido -> esperado 200 com photoUrl
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto-teste.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 13. FALHA PROPOSITAL: upload para paciente inexistente -> esperado 404
POST {{host}}/api/patients/9999/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto-teste.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 14. FALHA PROPOSITAL: upload sem arquivo -> esperado 422
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 15. FALHA PROPOSITAL: upload de arquivo grande demais (>2MB) -> esperado 413
### Gere um arquivo de teste maior que 2MB antes de rodar este bloco.
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto-grande.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto-grande.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--
